      "text": "Section 5. Continuing Validity of Nominations. After a\nnominee is appointed, the remaining nominations shall be valid for\nappointment to any vacancy occurring in that commission, board or\nother public body within six months after their submission to the\nMayor; provided, however, that the Committee may nominate additional\npersons to fill any such vacancy, and may renominate persons for any\nsuch vacancy occurring more than six months after their prior\nsubmission.",
